==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Legend Maker|Lunatone|20}} from the {{TCG|EX Legend Maker}} expansion.
*'''Moon Press''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Celesteela-GX|67}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos}}.
